== Effects ==
* Raises the default chance for a {{R|Planetarium}} to spawn from 1% to 10%.
** This influences the chance after having already entered a Planetarium, keeping it at 10%.
* Further increases the chance for a Planetarium to spawn by 15% if one has not been entered yet.
** Combined with the raised default chance, this adds up to a perceived +24% chance increase when first picked up.
* Makes it possible for Planetariums to spawn in [[Chapter 4]] and {{s|Corpse}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{I|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either increases the default chance by 18%. Having both increases the default chance by 33% and Planetariums can also spawn in {{s|Cathedral}} and {{s|Sheol}}.

